Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:44:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] app: talk to a system socket instead of sudo when it
 exists

fp5_qtee_transport picks the socket (/run/fp5-qtee/session.sock) or the
old sudo -n path (FP5_QTEE_TRANSPORT forces one). SocketSession mimics the
Popen subset the watcher and Finger app use; stopping it sends quit and
closes the connection instead of killpg. /usr/libexec and /usr/share
paths are tried first; firmware dir defaults to /var/lib/firmware/qsee.
